{"lang":"zh-TW","total":11,"items":[{"u":"/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-entertainment-380000-ai-dramas-later-chinas-animation/","t":"38萬部AI短劇之後：中國動畫淘金熱撞上現實","h":false,"s":"今年，製作方將數十萬部AI生成的動畫微短劇傾瀉到中國各大平台，結果卻眼睜睜看著分潤縮水、工作室接連倒閉。隨著泡沫消退，倖存者正從日本1980年代動畫熱潮中尋找前進的方向。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-24/20260924-entertainment-380000-ai-dramas-later-chinas-animation-v3.webp","ci":"🎬","ct":"娛樂","cc":"#db2777","d":"2026年9月24日","m":"閱讀時間 3 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/entertainment/","l":"娛樂"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/animation/","l":"動畫"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-entertainment-chinas-animation-industry-captures-global-imagination-x/","t":"中國動產業捕捉全球想像力","h":false,"s":"中國動產業正快速從國內娛樂轉向國際讚譽，將傳統文化元素與尖端技術相結合，創造出具有全球吸引力的內容。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-24/20260924-entertainment-chinas-animation-industry-captures-global-imagination-x-v3.webp","ci":"🎬","ct":"娛樂","cc":"#db2777","d":"2026年9月24日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/animation/","l":"動畫"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/entertainment/","l":"娛樂"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-entertainment-chinas-animation-industry-captures-global-imagination/","t":"中國動漫產業捕捉全球想像力","h":false,"s":"曾深受外來風格影響的中國動漫產業，如今結合傳統文化元素與尖端技術，創作出引起全球共鳴的內容。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-24/20260924-entertainment-chinas-animation-industry-captures-global-imagination-v3.webp","ci":"🎬","ct":"娛樂","cc":"#db2777","d":"2026年9月24日","m":"閱讀時間 1 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/animation/","l":"動畫"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/entertainment/","l":"娛樂"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-entertainment-you-benchang-beloved-ji-gong-actor/","t":"深受喜愛的「濟公」演員游本昌逝世，享年93歲","h":false,"s":"游本昌，這位以破爛衣衫飾演傳奇「瘋僧」濟公、迷倒數代觀眾的中國演員，已在北京逝世，享年93歲。在數十年的小舞台角色之後，他在52歲時成名，並在90歲時因熱門劇集《繁花》贏得新一代粉絲。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-24/20260924-entertainment-you-benchang-beloved-ji-gong-actor-v3.webp","ci":"🎬","ct":"娛樂","cc":"#db2777","d":"2026年9月24日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/entertainment/","l":"娛樂"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/film/","l":"電影"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-e